1
00:01:05,640 --> 00:01:06,240
Sir,

2
00:01:07,880 --> 00:01:08,480
are you

3
00:01:10,440 --> 00:01:11,560
okay?

4
00:01:38,520 --> 00:01:39,520
I'm a traffic police officer.

5
00:01:39,520 --> 00:01:41,180
There was an accident, right?

6
00:01:44,920 --> 00:01:45,850
Traffic police?

7
00:01:47,039 --> 00:01:49,170
But I haven't even called the cops yet.

8
00:01:50,479 --> 00:01:51,140
I'm on duty.

9
00:01:51,280 --> 00:01:52,210
Just passing by.

10
00:01:55,160 --> 00:01:56,280
What do we do now?

11
00:01:56,440 --> 00:01:57,840
I just went over to check.

12
00:01:58,039 --> 00:01:59,039
The person is already dead.

13
00:01:59,039 --> 00:02:00,770
Let's process the scene first.

14
00:02:02,480 --> 00:02:03,400
Process...

15
00:02:04,960 --> 00:02:06,080
the scene?

16
00:02:06,760 --> 00:02:08,320
Pull your car over first.

17
00:02:08,320 --> 00:02:09,720
Don't block the traffic.

18
00:03:17,280 --> 00:03:18,880
Comrade, what's the matter?

19
00:03:20,560 --> 00:03:21,890
I want to turn myself in.

20
00:03:28,640 --> 00:03:29,440
Captain Li,

21
00:03:29,920 --> 00:03:30,720
it's him.

22
00:03:31,040 --> 00:03:31,840
Are you sure?

23
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:33,930
Do you need him to...

24
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:35,160
No need for a mask.

25
00:03:35,320 --> 00:03:37,040
His eyes are too distinctive.

26
00:03:37,640 --> 00:03:38,700
I've recalled them

27
00:03:39,280 --> 00:03:41,880
countless times in my mind
these past few days.

28
00:03:42,040 --> 00:03:43,170
I won't be mistaken.

29
00:03:50,040 --> 00:03:50,680
Name?

30
00:03:51,400 --> 00:03:51,960
Xiao Ze.

31
00:03:52,880 --> 00:03:53,280
Age?

32
00:03:53,600 --> 00:03:54,240
30.

33
00:03:55,520 --> 00:03:56,240
ID number.

34
00:04:03,320 --> 00:04:04,050
Freelancer.

35
00:04:05,440 --> 00:04:08,000
What is your relationship

36
00:04:08,000 --> 00:04:09,600
with Shen Xi and Gao Yuhai,

37
00:04:09,920 --> 00:04:12,760
the two parties involved
in the October 23rd accident?

38
00:04:12,760 --> 00:04:13,760
No relationship.

39
00:04:13,920 --> 00:04:14,720
None.

40
00:04:14,920 --> 00:04:16,519
You mean you don't know them?

41
00:04:17,440 --> 00:04:19,560
I know them. I know both of them.

42
00:04:22,240 --> 00:04:23,840
But neither of them knows me.

43
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:26,320
Gao Yuhai, the one
who was killed in the crash,

44
00:04:26,320 --> 00:04:27,200
is a celebrity.

45
00:04:28,040 --> 00:04:29,500
But I didn't recognize him

46
00:04:29,520 --> 00:04:30,520
at the time.

47
00:04:31,560 --> 00:04:34,360
I only found out it was him
after watching the news.

48
00:04:36,440 --> 00:04:38,440
As for the female driver, Shen Xi...

49
00:04:42,040 --> 00:04:43,840
Shen Xi is already gone.

50
00:04:44,000 --> 00:04:46,930
Just answer the questions
about yourself honestly.

51
00:04:47,440 --> 00:04:48,240
Officer,

52
00:04:49,320 --> 00:04:49,880
she

53
00:04:51,040 --> 00:04:52,320
is my sweetheart.

54
00:04:53,040 --> 00:04:54,080
You mean

55
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:56,860
it's unrequited love?

56
00:04:57,920 --> 00:04:58,960
That's right.

57
00:05:01,040 --> 00:05:02,300
The first time I saw her

58
00:05:03,640 --> 00:05:05,160
was over a year ago,

59
00:05:06,240 --> 00:05:08,570
downstairs in our residential compound.

60
00:05:17,440 --> 00:05:18,360
Young lady,

61
00:05:18,560 --> 00:05:19,160
let me

62
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:20,320
help you with that.

63
00:05:20,320 --> 00:05:21,440
Did you just move in?

64
00:05:21,440 --> 00:05:22,560
Thanks, but I'm fine.

65
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:23,560
I just moved in.

66
00:05:24,320 --> 00:05:25,320
I rented a place

67
00:05:26,040 --> 00:05:27,880
on the top floor of Building 3.

68
00:05:28,880 --> 00:05:29,880
You're so young,

69
00:05:29,880 --> 00:05:30,680
about the same age

70
00:05:30,680 --> 00:05:32,200
as my sister.

71
00:05:32,200 --> 00:05:33,520
Let me walk you there.

72
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:34,960
Otherwise, it'll be hard

73
00:05:34,960 --> 00:05:36,520
to get this cart into the elevator.

74
00:05:36,520 --> 00:05:38,120
Thanks, but I'm really fine.

75
00:05:40,040 --> 00:05:41,560
What's your name?

76
00:05:41,560 --> 00:05:43,320
Are you still in school or working?

77
00:05:43,320 --> 00:05:45,159
My last name is Shen. Shen Xi,

78
00:05:45,320 --> 00:05:46,450
'Xi' as in 'stream'.

79
00:05:46,600 --> 00:05:48,080
I work at the dance center

80
00:05:48,080 --> 00:05:49,560
near the factory gate.

81
00:05:49,640 --> 00:05:50,840
I'm a dance teacher.

82
00:05:51,040 --> 00:05:51,960
The top floor here

83
00:05:51,960 --> 00:05:53,159
is really beautiful.

84
00:05:53,280 --> 00:05:54,880
There's a garden up there.

85
00:05:55,040 --> 00:05:56,320
You can plant flowers

86
00:05:56,320 --> 00:05:57,440
and dance there.

87
00:05:57,440 --> 00:05:58,360
It's gorgeous.

88
00:05:59,480 --> 00:06:01,680
That's exactly why I rented this place.

89
00:06:05,560 --> 00:06:06,960
You mean

90
00:06:07,400 --> 00:06:08,960
love at first sight?

91
00:06:11,640 --> 00:06:12,600
Xiao Ze,

92
00:06:12,760 --> 00:06:15,160
we're not here to listen
to your love story.

93
00:06:15,560 --> 00:06:16,320
We want to know

94
00:06:16,320 --> 00:06:18,250
why you impersonated a traffic cop

95
00:06:18,440 --> 00:06:20,300
to help Shen Xi destroy the scene.

96
00:06:20,440 --> 00:06:21,200
Understand?

97
00:06:21,200 --> 00:06:22,800
I'm getting to it,

98
00:06:23,760 --> 00:06:24,560
officer.

99
00:06:25,440 --> 00:06:26,520
Are all you cops

100
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:28,400
this impatient?

101
00:06:31,360 --> 00:06:32,360
We have patience.

102
00:06:33,040 --> 00:06:33,680
Go on.

103
00:06:34,120 --> 00:06:35,720
After love at first sight...

104
00:06:36,320 --> 00:06:37,650
The first time I saw her,

105
00:06:38,320 --> 00:06:40,080
I felt she had

106
00:06:40,680 --> 00:06:42,120
a unique aura.

107
00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:44,800
Maybe it's because we're both dancers.

108
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:45,930
You're a dancer too?

109
00:06:48,640 --> 00:06:49,560
I studied it,

110
00:06:50,320 --> 00:06:51,450
but gave it up later.

111
00:06:51,600 --> 00:06:52,440
Now,

112
00:06:53,159 --> 00:06:54,600
I'm an amateur at best.

113
00:06:55,040 --> 00:06:56,370
My dad is a businessman.

114
00:06:56,800 --> 00:06:57,800
He has some money

115
00:06:58,200 --> 00:06:59,600
but no time for me.

116
00:07:00,040 --> 00:07:01,960
I just live in my own apartment,

117
00:07:02,440 --> 00:07:03,300
playing games,

118
00:07:03,360 --> 00:07:03,840
surfing the net,

119
00:07:03,840 --> 00:07:05,570
and hitting the bars every day.

120
00:07:05,720 --> 00:07:07,240
Life was pretty boring,

121
00:07:09,600 --> 00:07:11,120
until Shen Xi showed up.

122
00:07:12,400 --> 00:07:13,600
Her appearance

123
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:17,320
was like a ray of light.

124
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:19,840
She brings color to my days.

125
00:07:20,240 --> 00:07:21,440
Sorry to interrupt.

126
00:07:22,240 --> 00:07:23,440
I just asked Shen Xi.

127
00:07:23,440 --> 00:07:25,000
She said she doesn't know you.

128
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:25,600
Yeah,

129
00:07:25,840 --> 00:07:26,970
she doesn't know me.

130
00:07:27,240 --> 00:07:29,440
But that doesn't stop me from liking her.

131
00:07:29,440 --> 00:07:31,500
She dances on that balcony every day.

132
00:07:32,440 --> 00:07:33,560
You have no idea

133
00:07:36,360 --> 00:07:37,560
how beautiful she is.

134
00:07:39,159 --> 00:07:41,020
I even bought a pair of binoculars

135
00:07:41,360 --> 00:07:42,800
just for this.

136
00:07:44,200 --> 00:07:45,200
At that time,

137
00:07:45,920 --> 00:07:47,520
I knew there was some dance competition

138
00:07:47,520 --> 00:07:48,800
going on around here.

139
00:07:49,560 --> 00:07:51,200
Shen Xi was practicing like crazy

140
00:07:51,200 --> 00:07:53,000
every day for that competition.

141
00:07:53,720 --> 00:07:55,200
The more I watched,
the more I fell for her.

142
00:07:55,200 --> 00:07:56,120
The more I fell,
the more anxious I became,

143
00:07:56,120 --> 00:07:57,720
and the less I knew how to approach her.

144
00:07:57,720 --> 00:07:58,960
S-S-Stop.

145
00:07:59,400 --> 00:08:00,160
Xiao Ze,

146
00:08:01,120 --> 00:08:02,680
you can just tell her.

147
00:08:03,040 --> 00:08:03,840
Tell her

148
00:08:03,840 --> 00:08:05,000
you live across from her,

149
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:06,840
that you like watching her dance,

150
00:08:06,840 --> 00:08:07,880
that y-you like her as a person,

151
00:08:07,880 --> 00:08:08,880
that you're her fan,

152
00:08:08,880 --> 00:08:10,210
and that you admire her.

153
00:08:10,920 --> 00:08:12,650
Isn't that a very simple thing?

154
00:08:12,840 --> 00:08:14,320
Young officer,

155
00:08:16,640 --> 00:08:18,640
you've never been in love, have you?

156
00:08:20,040 --> 00:08:21,240
N-No.

157
00:08:22,240 --> 00:08:23,200
I guessed so.

158
00:08:24,400 --> 00:08:25,040
Love

159
00:08:25,960 --> 00:08:27,240
is not that simple.

160
00:08:28,320 --> 00:08:29,280
True love

161
00:08:30,040 --> 00:08:32,570
comes with the pressure
of gaining and losing

162
00:08:32,960 --> 00:08:35,200
before it's confirmed to be mutual.

163
00:08:36,240 --> 00:08:37,360
Officers,

164
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:39,000
don't you

165
00:08:39,440 --> 00:08:40,000
agree?

166
00:08:41,919 --> 00:08:44,039
Xiao Ze, I'll say it again.

167
00:08:44,720 --> 00:08:45,800
We don't want to hear

168
00:08:45,800 --> 00:08:47,120
things unrelated to this case.

169
00:08:47,120 --> 00:08:48,040
Can you tell us now

170
00:08:48,040 --> 00:08:49,600
why you pretended to be a traffic cop?

171
00:08:49,600 --> 00:08:50,860
You're rushing again.

172
00:08:52,600 --> 00:08:54,240
You're really impatient.

173
00:08:54,680 --> 00:08:55,740
I'm getting to that

174
00:08:56,840 --> 00:08:57,960
right now.

175
00:09:00,840 --> 00:09:01,760
Okay, go on.

176
00:09:02,640 --> 00:09:03,320
That day,

177
00:09:04,360 --> 00:09:05,440
I went to a bar.

178
00:09:06,760 --> 00:09:08,000
I met a group of kids.

179
00:09:09,240 --> 00:09:10,640
They were having a blast.

180
00:09:11,920 --> 00:09:13,450
They were all into cosplay.

181
00:09:16,360 --> 00:09:17,640
You again.

182
00:09:18,440 --> 00:09:20,000
Truth or dare?

183
00:09:21,720 --> 00:09:22,840
Dare.

184
00:09:23,560 --> 00:09:24,640
Dare, right?

185
00:09:26,000 --> 00:09:27,930
Pretend to direct traffic outside

186
00:09:28,240 --> 00:09:30,600
and say a few words to the drivers.

187
00:09:30,600 --> 00:09:32,000
Then your task is complete.

188
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:33,000
No, no.

189
00:09:33,000 --> 00:09:33,920
That's illegal.

190
00:09:33,920 --> 00:09:34,840
I'm not going.

191
00:09:35,000 --> 00:09:36,200
You're no fun.

192
00:09:36,560 --> 00:09:37,720
What did we ask you to do?

193
00:09:37,720 --> 00:09:38,560
What law are you breaking?

194
00:09:38,560 --> 00:09:39,000
Exactly.

195
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:40,120
If you don't go,

196
00:09:40,320 --> 00:09:42,000
you have to drink all this.

197
00:09:46,240 --> 00:09:47,520
We just asked you to play a cop,

198
00:09:47,520 --> 00:09:48,840
nothing else.

199
00:09:48,840 --> 00:09:50,280
We're never bringing you out again.

200
00:09:50,280 --> 00:09:51,200
So boring.

201
00:09:51,200 --> 00:09:53,460
You can't even finish these few bottles.

202
00:10:08,720 --> 00:10:10,200
I got curious,

203
00:10:10,480 --> 00:10:11,680
so I followed him out.

204
00:10:12,200 --> 00:10:14,660
The kid walked to the entrance,
waited a bit,

205
00:10:15,440 --> 00:10:17,170
and actually pulled over a car.

206
00:10:24,640 --> 00:10:25,480
At first,

207
00:10:25,920 --> 00:10:27,040
the driver

208
00:10:27,040 --> 00:10:28,370
was clearly terrified,

209
00:10:28,520 --> 00:10:30,760
respectfully asking
what traffic rule he had broken.

210
00:10:30,760 --> 00:10:32,440
Please show me your driver's license.

211
00:10:32,440 --> 00:10:33,600
Until he noticed

212
00:10:33,840 --> 00:10:34,880
something was wrong

213
00:10:34,880 --> 00:10:36,610
with Xiaosi's police uniform.

214
00:10:36,800 --> 00:10:38,460
You're a fake cop, aren't you?

215
00:10:39,880 --> 00:10:40,560
He looked

216
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:42,280
like a kid,

217
00:10:42,360 --> 00:10:43,920
so the driver started questioning him,

218
00:10:43,920 --> 00:10:45,960
scaring Xiaosi into running away.

219
00:10:47,720 --> 00:10:48,520
At the time,

220
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:51,260
I just thought the kid was quite amusing.

221
00:10:51,640 --> 00:10:52,560
But then,

222
00:10:53,040 --> 00:10:54,240
it suddenly occurred to me...

223
00:10:54,240 --> 00:10:54,800
Shen,

224
00:10:54,800 --> 00:10:56,520
The lady who helped her move.
Long time no see.

225
00:10:56,520 --> 00:10:57,720
Are you getting used to living here?

226
00:10:57,720 --> 00:10:59,240
I wanted to set her up with a boyfriend.

227
00:10:59,240 --> 00:11:00,360
I'm quite used to it.

228
00:11:00,360 --> 00:11:01,690
Do you have a boyfriend?

229
00:11:03,040 --> 00:11:03,840
Not yet.

230
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:04,760
If not,

231
00:11:04,840 --> 00:11:05,960
let me set you up with someone.

232
00:11:05,960 --> 00:11:06,640
He's a police officer,

233
00:11:06,640 --> 00:11:07,640
a really nice guy.

234
00:11:08,480 --> 00:11:09,000
Sure.

235
00:11:09,760 --> 00:11:10,800
A police officer sounds nice.

236
00:11:10,800 --> 00:11:12,800
When are you free?

237
00:11:12,800 --> 00:11:14,200
I'll arrange a meet-up for you two.

238
00:11:14,200 --> 00:11:15,480
Okay, sounds good.

239
00:11:15,720 --> 00:11:16,560
Okay, thank you.

240
00:11:16,560 --> 00:11:17,600
I'll head back now.

241
00:11:17,600 --> 00:11:18,720
Okay, sure. Bye.

242
00:11:19,040 --> 00:11:20,080
That was when

243
00:11:20,200 --> 00:11:21,000
I figured out

244
00:11:21,160 --> 00:11:23,020
she liked the police profession.

245
00:11:23,280 --> 00:11:24,410
I suddenly thought,

246
00:11:24,840 --> 00:11:26,440
wouldn't it be great

247
00:11:26,760 --> 00:11:28,600
if I dressed up as a cop

248
00:11:29,080 --> 00:11:30,320
and bumped into Shen Xi?

249
00:11:30,320 --> 00:11:32,040
If I pick one, it's up to me, right?

250
00:11:32,040 --> 00:11:32,720
So,

251
00:11:33,520 --> 00:11:35,080
I sent them two dozen beers

252
00:11:35,880 --> 00:11:37,400
to chat with them a bit more.

253
00:11:37,400 --> 00:11:38,400
A moment later...

254
00:11:39,640 --> 00:11:41,040
Hello, excuse me.

255
00:11:41,200 --> 00:11:41,960
Here are your drinks.

256
00:11:41,960 --> 00:11:43,490
We didn't order any drinks.

257
00:11:43,920 --> 00:11:45,580
They are from that gentleman.

258
00:11:48,440 --> 00:11:49,170
Thanks, man.

259
00:11:49,200 --> 00:11:51,060
Come over and have a drink with us.

260
00:11:54,200 --> 00:11:56,520
Ze gave us two dozen beers back then.

261
00:11:56,760 --> 00:11:58,840
That was a real lifesaver for us.

262
00:11:59,200 --> 00:12:00,280
We were just teenagers

263
00:12:00,280 --> 00:12:01,810
with barely any money on us.

264
00:12:01,920 --> 00:12:02,840
We had so little booze,

265
00:12:02,840 --> 00:12:04,500
we were reluctant to drink it.

266
00:12:04,560 --> 00:12:05,920
So that was the day

267
00:12:05,920 --> 00:12:07,400
you met the fake Xiao Ze?

268
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:10,240
I asked him his name.

269
00:12:10,440 --> 00:12:12,000
He said his name was Jia Xiaoze.

270
00:12:12,000 --> 00:12:13,360
I thought his surname was Jia.

271
00:12:13,360 --> 00:12:15,640
Who knew he was a fake Xiao Ze?

272
00:12:15,840 --> 00:12:17,440
Jia, let me toast you.

273
00:12:17,440 --> 00:12:18,400
You're so generous,

274
00:12:18,400 --> 00:12:20,260
giving us two dozen beers at once.

275
00:12:21,520 --> 00:12:22,200
Well,

276
00:12:22,760 --> 00:12:24,320
I'm used to being called Ze.

277
00:12:24,320 --> 00:12:25,180
Just call me Ze.

278
00:12:26,160 --> 00:12:26,960
Everyone,

279
00:12:27,040 --> 00:12:28,640
thanks to Ze for the beers.

280
00:12:28,640 --> 00:12:30,760
From now on, Ze is our good friend, right?

281
00:12:30,760 --> 00:12:31,920
Right.

282
00:12:40,440 --> 00:12:41,720
Your cosplay

283
00:12:41,880 --> 00:12:42,960
is pretty fun.

284
00:12:43,840 --> 00:12:44,800
Especially you,

285
00:12:45,560 --> 00:12:46,560
playing a cop just now

286
00:12:46,560 --> 00:12:47,960
and gesturing at that driver.

287
00:12:47,960 --> 00:12:49,400
You've got some nerve,

288
00:12:49,560 --> 00:12:51,000
kid.

289
00:12:51,800 --> 00:12:52,920
To be honest, Ze,

290
00:12:52,920 --> 00:12:54,450
I'm still nervous even now.

291
00:12:55,040 --> 00:12:56,300
But thinking about it,

292
00:12:56,440 --> 00:12:58,280
this adrenaline rush

293
00:12:58,280 --> 00:12:59,640
feels amazing.

294
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:01,930
Come on, Ze, let me toast you again.

295
00:13:08,960 --> 00:13:10,800
I heard you guys chatting earlier,

296
00:13:10,800 --> 00:13:12,760
saying you shoot videos
and post them online.

297
00:13:12,760 --> 00:13:14,560
How is it? Getting any traction?

298
00:13:14,800 --> 00:13:16,330
Nobody watches them at all.

299
00:13:17,040 --> 00:13:17,920
Cosplay

300
00:13:17,920 --> 00:13:19,250
hasn't really caught on

301
00:13:19,320 --> 00:13:20,840
in our country yet.

302
00:13:22,120 --> 00:13:23,240
I think

303
00:13:24,120 --> 00:13:25,920
it's just not thrilling enough.

304
00:13:26,440 --> 00:13:28,200
If you play a cop like you just did,

305
00:13:28,200 --> 00:13:29,600
direct traffic on the street,

306
00:13:29,600 --> 00:13:31,000
film it, and post it online,

307
00:13:31,000 --> 00:13:32,530
it'll definitely go viral.

308
00:13:34,520 --> 00:13:35,800
That sounds good,

309
00:13:36,400 --> 00:13:38,160
but if real cops find out,

310
00:13:38,720 --> 00:13:40,450
I won't even be able to run away.

311
00:13:40,600 --> 00:13:42,160
If you really want to go viral,

312
00:13:42,160 --> 00:13:43,840
I can help you figure something out.

313
00:13:43,840 --> 00:13:44,880
We got close

314
00:13:45,280 --> 00:13:46,760
after that night.

315
00:13:47,240 --> 00:13:48,440
I said I liked motorcycles,

316
00:13:48,440 --> 00:13:49,440
so he gave me one.

317
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:51,400
Just to play around with.

318
00:13:51,760 --> 00:13:52,640
I have to say,

319
00:13:52,920 --> 00:13:54,680
Ze is really well-off.

320
00:13:55,000 --> 00:13:56,000
He's really rich.

321
00:13:56,240 --> 00:13:57,640
Bai, don't get off topic.

322
00:13:57,800 --> 00:13:59,200
Think about it.

323
00:13:59,200 --> 00:14:00,560
Xiao Ze isn't stupid.

324
00:14:01,120 --> 00:14:03,200
He bought you a police uniform,

325
00:14:03,200 --> 00:14:05,320
props, and even a motorcycle.

326
00:14:05,760 --> 00:14:07,220
What does he want from you?

327
00:14:07,640 --> 00:14:09,170
I never thought about that.

328
00:14:09,480 --> 00:14:11,160
I have rich friends too.

329
00:14:12,000 --> 00:14:12,920
If you ask me,

330
00:14:13,320 --> 00:14:14,600
they're just bored,

331
00:14:14,600 --> 00:14:15,720
using me for fun.

332
00:14:16,360 --> 00:14:18,020
I have nothing to lose anyway.

333
00:14:18,160 --> 00:14:20,020
I don't care what his reasons are.

334
00:14:22,160 --> 00:14:23,000
Why?

335
00:14:24,560 --> 00:14:25,360
Officer,

336
00:14:26,120 --> 00:14:27,850
aren't you asking the obvious?

337
00:14:28,200 --> 00:14:29,440
To figure out

338
00:14:29,920 --> 00:14:31,840
if this thing is actually illegal.

339
00:14:31,840 --> 00:14:33,800
I can't risk getting locked up

340
00:14:34,520 --> 00:14:35,920
just to meet Shen Xi.

341
00:14:36,640 --> 00:14:37,840
I get it now.

342
00:14:37,920 --> 00:14:39,520
You're saying

343
00:14:39,800 --> 00:14:41,600
Bai Xiaosi was just a guinea pig.

344
00:14:42,200 --> 00:14:43,060
Officer Jiang,

345
00:14:44,160 --> 00:14:45,840
you shouldn't put it like that.

346
00:14:45,840 --> 00:14:47,320
That sounds terrible.

347
00:14:47,960 --> 00:14:49,080
Bai Xiaosi

348
00:14:50,160 --> 00:14:51,820
didn't really lose anything.

349
00:14:52,640 --> 00:14:54,240
Just a few days in detention.

350
00:14:55,720 --> 00:14:57,160
Now can you tell us

351
00:14:57,160 --> 00:14:58,600
what exactly happened

352
00:14:58,880 --> 00:15:00,240
on October 23rd?

353
00:15:00,800 --> 00:15:01,860
Alright, alright.

354
00:15:02,640 --> 00:15:03,600
Since we're

355
00:15:04,200 --> 00:15:05,120
on the subject.

356
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:07,560
Actually, before that day,

357
00:15:08,440 --> 00:15:11,300
Shen Xi hadn't danced
on the rooftop for a long time.

358
00:15:11,720 --> 00:15:13,200
Do you know why?

359
00:15:13,520 --> 00:15:14,320
No idea.

360
00:15:15,120 --> 00:15:15,800
I guess

361
00:15:17,000 --> 00:15:19,060
failing to place in that competition

362
00:15:19,120 --> 00:15:20,200
upset her.

363
00:15:20,800 --> 00:15:22,330
Anyway, she rarely danced.

364
00:15:23,400 --> 00:15:24,280
Maybe

365
00:15:24,920 --> 00:15:26,680
she was just tired from her dance classes

366
00:15:26,680 --> 00:15:27,440
at school.

367
00:15:28,000 --> 00:15:29,080
After all, girls

368
00:15:29,560 --> 00:15:30,820
have limited stamina.

369
00:15:32,560 --> 00:15:33,440
But

370
00:15:34,080 --> 00:15:35,440
on the 23rd,

371
00:15:37,600 --> 00:15:38,800
she danced again.

372
00:15:40,120 --> 00:15:40,960
And...

373
00:15:41,960 --> 00:15:43,600
It was absolutely stunning.

374
00:15:44,640 --> 00:15:46,200
The dusk that day

375
00:15:46,720 --> 00:15:48,850
was like someone spilled orange soda.

376
00:15:49,560 --> 00:15:53,240
The whole sky was a warm, glowing orange.

377
00:15:54,160 --> 00:15:56,160
She was wearing a white gauze dress.

378
00:15:56,240 --> 00:15:58,760
The setting sun stretched her shadow long

379
00:15:59,360 --> 00:16:01,000
against the mottled wall.

380
00:16:01,360 --> 00:16:03,200
She was a real person,

381
00:16:03,840 --> 00:16:05,570
but her every move made her look

382
00:16:05,600 --> 00:16:07,800
like a fairy stepping out of a painting.

383
00:16:08,400 --> 00:16:09,320
In a daze,

384
00:16:09,520 --> 00:16:11,200
I couldn't tell if it was
the afterglow of the sunset

385
00:16:11,200 --> 00:16:13,240
or the light radiating from her.

386
00:16:14,000 --> 00:16:15,680
I just stood there,

387
00:16:16,680 --> 00:16:17,600
watching.

388
00:16:18,800 --> 00:16:20,120
All I could think was,

389
00:16:21,560 --> 00:16:22,840
how could anyone

390
00:16:23,480 --> 00:16:24,640
be so beautiful?

391
00:16:25,320 --> 00:16:26,120
Later,

392
00:16:27,040 --> 00:16:28,100
the dance ended...

393
00:16:29,000 --> 00:16:30,730
the weather started to change.

394
00:16:30,800 --> 00:16:32,600
The clouds got thicker.

395
00:16:33,520 --> 00:16:35,320
I checked the weather forecast.

396
00:16:36,920 --> 00:16:39,400
It was a stormy night,

397
00:16:40,520 --> 00:16:43,120
the likes of which
hadn't been seen in decades.

398
00:16:43,600 --> 00:16:45,130
To my surprise, I found that

399
00:16:46,040 --> 00:16:47,440
Shen Xi had gone out.

400
00:16:48,480 --> 00:16:49,440
One.

401
00:16:50,040 --> 00:16:51,440
I was afraid

402
00:16:52,360 --> 00:16:54,040
Shen Xi would be in danger
going out in this kind of weather.

403
00:16:54,040 --> 00:16:55,200
Also,

404
00:16:56,000 --> 00:16:58,120
it would be wonderful

405
00:16:58,120 --> 00:16:59,200
to meet her

406
00:16:59,720 --> 00:17:01,440
on such a stormy night.

407
00:17:02,640 --> 00:17:04,520
I had the police uniform ready

408
00:17:04,839 --> 00:17:06,119
and kept it in my car.

409
00:17:07,839 --> 00:17:09,400
I just never had the courage

410
00:17:09,560 --> 00:17:10,240
to dress up as a cop

411
00:17:10,240 --> 00:17:11,240
and bump into her.

412
00:17:12,000 --> 00:17:12,800
I decided

413
00:17:14,119 --> 00:17:15,250
that day was the day.

414
00:17:16,400 --> 00:17:17,930
I couldn't wait any longer.

415
00:17:18,000 --> 00:17:18,680
So...

416
00:17:19,119 --> 00:17:20,720
I just followed her in my car.

417
00:17:20,839 --> 00:17:22,240
Where did she drive to?

418
00:17:24,760 --> 00:17:26,089
Nowhere in particular.

419
00:17:27,240 --> 00:17:29,240
She seemed to be heading somewhere,

420
00:17:29,240 --> 00:17:30,170
passed by there,

421
00:17:30,280 --> 00:17:32,080
and then the accident happened.

422
00:17:33,440 --> 00:17:34,600
Did she stop

423
00:17:35,000 --> 00:17:36,440
and then rush forward,

424
00:17:36,720 --> 00:17:38,580
or was she driving the whole time?

425
00:17:38,600 --> 00:17:39,400
She stopped.

426
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:41,320
How could it stop?

427
00:17:42,800 --> 00:17:44,160
If it could really stop,

428
00:17:45,040 --> 00:17:47,240
that accident wouldn't have happened.

